    "title": "March Madness: Texas vs Michigan score draws heavy reaction",
    "text": "There's domination and then there's what Texas women's basketball  did to a very solid Michigan squad on Monday. After a 2-2 tie, Texas opened up a double-digit lead that threatened 30 points of separation. It ended with a 77-41 win for the Longhorns. Madison Booker had 19 points, Justice Carlton chipped in 15 points and Rori Harmon racked up seven points, 13 assists and seven rebounds. GOLDEN: Texas basketball reaches 2nd straight Final Four. Here's how it happened Now the Longhorns will play UCLA in the Final Four, a rematch of Texas' November win over the Bruins — losing to Texas is UCLA's only loss of the season.  But first, let's see what people had to say about the massive win. Here are some reactions from the game: Former Longhorn Kevin Durant showing some love, maybe. You'll never guess how Vic Schaefer is spending his Tuesday. Or, maybe you would. ",
